  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\st0072_e565cfa4c5df.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" /><br /><br /><br /><br />for <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo></math></p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#969;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> ......(i)<br /><br />for <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo></math></p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#969;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></math> ....(ii)</p><p>Dividing both the equations:</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac></math></p>"
